tika Simple arithmetic in Omar++

dekhao 10 jog 5;                    tika addition
dekhao 10 biyog 3;                  tika subtraction
dekhao 6 gunon 7;                   tika multiplication
dekhao 20 vagfol 4;                 tika division
dekhao 7 vagfol 2;                  tika decimal result
dekhao 17 vagshesh 5;               tika remainder
dekhao 2 ghat 6;                    tika power
dekhao mulok(144);                  tika square root

tika precedence and brackets
dekhao 2 jog 3 gunon 4;
dekhao (2 jog 3) gunon 4;
dekhao -5 jog -8;

tika text works too
dekhao "Result: ";
dekhao "Omar" jog "++";
shesh
